          <p><strong style="font-size: 25px"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><b style="font-size: 26px"><span style="color: #010101">The INCOG offices will be<br />
              <span style="color: #F50408">CLOSED on Wednesday, November 11, 2026</span><br />
            in observance of Veterans Day
            <br />
          </span></b></font></strong></p>
          <hr />
          <p><span style="font-size: 25px"><strong style="font-size: 25px"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><b style="font-size: 26px"><span style="color: #000000">            Want to help make traveling easier <br />
            in the Tulsa region? </span></b></font> </strong></span><br />
            <br />
            <span style="font-size: 14px">Please review and comment on the draft INCOG Congestion Management Process Plan at <em><a href="http://incogcmp2026.com/" target="_blank"><strong>www.incogcmp2026.com</strong></a></em>. <br />
              The plan identifies where congestion occurs, what causes it, and strategies to improve travel reliability, safety, freight movement, and transportation choices throughout the Tulsa Transportation Management Area.  Let us know if we got it right! </span><br />
            <br />
            <br />
          </p></td>
